            "Only compare a mobile route after the clinical and technical teams have accepted its precise proposed use. Review acquisition capability, table access, procedural duty, required measurements and workflow as a complete configuration. Keep unaccepted procedures outside its business case. For an uncertain or small workload, referral may be the more credible comparator than expanding a mobile system beyond its demonstrated role."
