            "The same two examples list 32 kW and 75 kW respectively, while both have a 70 cm bore. A higher-tier purchase can change power and coverage without changing the opening through which the patient passes. These are configuration differences for the clinical team to evaluate, not universal minimum specifications or proof that one system is right for every routine service."
